<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales- USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, wtih no slaughter steer or heifer sales confirmed. Inquiry moderate, demand light. Sales confirmed for the week on 65,300 head including 23,900 head or about 37 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed -   none   last week - 10,500   last year - 23,200</p>
<p>Wk to date - 65,300  last week - 28,500   last year - 65,600</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
